id: warriors-of-glass-third-effect
name: 3rd effect of Warriors of Glass
type: instant
actionCost: 0
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: warriors-of-glass
fromEffect: 3
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Warriors of Glass's third effect, as a Maneuver: the Glass Soldiers moved up to 1/2 of your Force or Magic Score.
text: >
  (3)-[1/Round]: As an Instant Maneuver, you may move any number of Glass Soldiers by a number of Squares up to 1/2 of your Force or Magic Score (whichever is higher). You cannot cause Collision with this movement.

---

# As the first effect's: in the list while Warriors of Glass is had. Used, how far said on a card - 1/2 of the higher of the
# Force and Magic Scores, rounded down; the moving is the table's (chat.mjs glassSoldiersMove).
[on used]
glassSoldiersMove();
